```console
$ scherzo-cloud runner disable --help
Disable a Scherzo Cloud runner registration

Usage: scherzo-cloud runner disable [OPTIONS] <ORGANIZATION> <RUNNER>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug
  <RUNNER>        Runner ID or exact name

Options:
      --json                           Print the runner result as JSON
      --service-api-key-file <PATH|->  Authenticate with a service API key from a private file, or - for standard input
      --allow-insecure-http            Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                           Print help

```
